      "reading": "beoseu yogeum inhaga baro banyeongdwaesseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The bus fare reduction took effect right away.",
        "ko": "버스 요금 인하가 바로 반영됐어요.",
        "ipa": "beoseu yogeum inhaga baro banyeongdwaesseoyo.",
        "ar": "دخل خفض أجرة الحافلة حيز التنفيذ على الفور.",
        "cs": "Snížení jízdného v autobuse se projevilo hned.",
